.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_HASH 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_hash_sysv ,
.Nm elf_hash_gnu
.Nd compute ELF symbol hash values
.Sh LIBRARY
libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft uint32_t
.Fn elf_hash_sysv "const char *name"
.Ft uint32_t
.Fn elf_hash_gnu "const char *name"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These functions compute the standard ELF symbol hash values used by
.Dv SHT_HASH
(System V) and
.Dv GNU_HASH
lookups.
.Pp
.Fn elf_hash_sysv
implements the classic ELF hash algorithm used by SysV hash tables.
.Fn elf_hash_gnu
implements the GNU hash algorithm used by
.Pa .gnu.hash
symbol tables.
.Pp
Both functions are deterministic and side-effect free.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Both functions return the hash value for
.Fa name .
If
.Fa name
is NULL, the returned value is implementation-defined.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
uint32_t h_sysv = elf_hash_sysv("printf");
uint32_t h_gnu  = elf_hash_gnu("printf");
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_symbol 3 ,
.Xr elfobj 3
